## Backend Changes

### New Files

#### [NEW] [advancePayment.controller.js](file:///d:/Client%20Projects/Fortunate%20Business%20Management/fortunate-business-management-backend/controllers/advancePayment.controller.js)

| Function | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `createAdvancePayment` | Deducts from account, creates expense transaction, creates advance record |
| `getAllAdvancePayments` | Paginated list with filters (status, date range, supplier search) |
| `getAdvancePaymentById` | Single advance with populated account + refund details |
| `settleAdvancePayment` | Marks "Settled" or "Partially Settled" — no money movement |
| `refundAdvancePayment` | Creates refund entry, credits chosen account, creates income transaction. Validates `refundAmount ≤ remainingAmount` |
| `deleteAdvancePayment` | Same-day only. Hard-deletes transactions, reverses balances, soft-deletes advance |
| `getAdvancePaymentStats` | Summary: total pending amount, count by status |

#### [NEW] [advancePayment.routes.js](file:///d:/Client%20Projects/Fortunate%20Business%20Management/fortunate-business-management-backend/routes/api/advancePayment.routes.js)

```
POST   /api/advance-payments              → createAdvancePayment
GET    /api/advance-payments              → getAllAdvancePayments
GET    /api/advance-payments/stats        → getAdvancePaymentStats
GET    /api/advance-payments/:id          → getAdvancePaymentById
PUT    /api/advance-payments/:id/settle   → settleAdvancePayment
PUT    /api/advance-payments/:id/refund   → refundAdvancePayment
DELETE /api/advance-payments/:id          → deleteAdvancePayment
```

