## Verification Plan

### Manual Test Scenarios

| # | Scenario | What to Verify |
|---|----------|---------------|
| 1 | Create advance | Account balance decreases, expense transaction appears in Transaction list and Daily Cash |
| 2 | View list | Filters by status, search by supplier, date range, pagination |
| 3 | Full refund | Money returns to chosen account, income transaction created, status → "Refunded" |
| 4 | Partial refund × 2 | Two refunds on same advance, remaining amount correct, status → "Partially Settled" |
| 5 | Settle after partial refund | Status → "Settled", no money moves |
| 6 | Refund to different account | Paid from Bank, refunded to Cash — both balances update correctly |
| 7 | Refund > remaining | Error: "Refund amount cannot exceed remaining amount" |
| 8 | Same-day delete | Transactions hard-deleted, balance restored, advance in trash |
| 9 | Non-same-day delete | Error: "Can only delete same-day advances" |
| 10 | Restore from trash | Advance restored, transactions re-created, balances updated |
| 11 | Daily cash closed | Create/refund blocked with proper error |
| 12 | Insufficient balance | Create blocked with proper error |
| 13 | Permissions | Non-authorized user can't see sidebar item or access API |
| 14 | Auto-transaction protection | User can't directly delete advance transactions from Transaction module |
